{"id":3745,"date":"2017-05-27T10:18:34","date_gmt":"2017-05-27T14:18:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3745"},"modified":"2017-05-27T10:18:34","modified_gmt":"2017-05-27T14:18:34","slug":"down-to-the-little-bitely-tavern","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/27\/down-to-the-little-bitely-tavern\/","title":{"rendered":"Down to The Little Bitely Tavern"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Our first night out of the park, we decided to run down the road a few miles to The Bitely Tavern where, on Thursdays, they offer their $2.00 hamburger.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3757\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3757\" style=\"width: 700px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3757 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map-1024x721.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"493\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map-1024x721.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map-300x211.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map-768x541.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/Bitely-Map.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3757\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">THIS is where you&#8217;ll find Bitely<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Bitely is a small village that currently boasts a gas station\/convenience store, township hall, the &#8220;Bitely Boys&#8221; Motorcycle Club, a post office, and it&#8217;s most popular inhabitant &#8230;. The Bitely Tavern. \u00a0It used to be a station on the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Chicago_and_Michigan_Lake_Shore_Railroad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chicago and Michigan Lake Shore Railroad<\/a>\u00a0in 1889.<\/p>\n<p>The place was PACKED with folks that obviously knew each other &#8230; those that live nearby and those that come &#8220;up north&#8221; on the weekends.<\/p>\n<p>Even though it was packed, we were served quickly and enjoyed our burgers AND liquid refreshment as well. \u00a0One of the fellas at the bar put money in the juke box and it blared country tunes of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B008SWV9GQ?ie=UTF8&amp;tag=herbnkathy-20&amp;camp=1789&amp;linkCode=xm2&amp;creativeASIN=B008SWV9GQ\">Johnny Cash<\/a> and <a href=\"http:\/\/amzn.to\/2qoHSSl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jim Reeves<\/a>. \u00a0The little 94 year old lady at the table next to us (right under the juke box) was there with her daughter and son-in-law. \u00a0Although she was sitting right UNDER the speakers, the bar maid had to keep turning UP THE VOLUME so she could hear!<\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 685px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-3745-1\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video\/mp4\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-22.54.42.mp4?_=1\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-22.54.42.mp4\">https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-22.54.42.mp4<\/a><\/video><\/div>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3745 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3747\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.37.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3747'>\n\t\t\t\twww.bitelyboys.com\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3748\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.02.29.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3748'>\n\t\t\t\tHome of &#8220;The Bitely Boys&#8221; Bike Club\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3750\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-19.01.45.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3750'>\n\t\t\t\tBitely Tavern\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3751\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.46.14.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3751'>\n\t\t\t\tOur $2 Burgers\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.18.47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.18.47-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3752\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.18.47-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.18.47-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.18.47-768x432.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3752'>\n\t\t\t\tThis Apple Ale&#8217;s pretty damn good!\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3753\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-25-18.17.00.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3753'>\n\t\t\t\tThe tavern menu (partial)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>The service was great, the food was good enough to come back again and try something else on the menu (what the hell does that mean?) and everyone there was having a good time. \u00a0We&#8217;ll go back and try the pizza next time.<\/p>\n<p>In our next post, we&#8217;ll share with you the &#8220;suburb&#8221; of Baldwin that was famous for top black entertainers from back in the 20&#8217;s to the mid-60&#8217;s. \u00a0Stay tuned &#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our first night out of the park, we decided to run down the road a few miles to The Bitely Tavern where, on Thursdays, they offer their $2.00 hamburger. Bitely is a small village that currently boasts a gas station\/convenience store, township hall, the &#8220;Bitely Boys&#8221; Motorcycle Club, a post office, and it&#8217;s most popular &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/27\/down-to-the-little-bitely-tavern\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Down to The Little Bitely Tavern<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707313,554707364,554707368,554707370,11110,554707369,554707366,18655,554707367,554707365,814],"class_list":["post-3745","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-beer","tag-bitely","tag-burgers","tag-harley","tag-michigan","tag-motorcycle","tag-newaygo","tag-pizza","tag-restaurant","tag-tavern","tag-wine"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3745","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3745"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3745\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3758,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3745\/revisions\/3758"}],"wp:attachment":[{"hre